        <item>
            <title>1.13.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 16:34:48 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1.13.0</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.13.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>✨ The Liquid Glass listening experience</h3>
                <p>Vox's dictation pill is reborn in Liquid Glass. Speak, and your words rise through a live teleprompter inside a single living pane of glass — the top line softly fading as new lines flow in. Stop, and the whole pill folds down in one continuous, glass-smooth motion: your text holds for a beat, then gracefully dissolves as the pill settles. No seams, no jumps — one fluid gesture, rendered entirely on-device.</p>
                <ul>
                  <li><strong>Live teleprompter</strong> that scrolls naturally as you dictate</li>
                  <li><strong>One seamless collapse</strong> — no flicker, no snap</li>
                  <li><strong>A fuller, livelier waveform</strong> while you speak</li>
                  <li><strong>Refined Listening settings</strong> — Toggle Dictation now leads</li>
                </ul>
                <p>Beautiful, fast, and 100% on your Mac.</p>
            ]]></description>
