        <item>
            <title>1.12.5</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 08 Jul 2026 17:12:14 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1.12.5</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.12.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>Redesigned dictation pill</h3>
                <ul>
                  <li>The recording pill now <strong>morphs as you dictate</strong> — growing to show your live transcript alongside a scrolling waveform, then settling back to a compact capsule when you're done.</li>
                  <li>It now renders in <strong>Liquid Glass</strong> that adapts to your system appearance, matching the playback mini-player.</li>
                </ul>
                <h3>Fixes</h3>
                <ul>
                  <li>Spoken audio now shows the correct play/pause state and accurate elapsed time in Control Center.</li>
                </ul>
